; $70(a6) is its state, +4 each call, into jtab_05100: state 0 its first part (sub_05136), state 1
; the chaser (sub_05186); each stays until an object slot is free (l_05108 takes the step back).
;-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
sub_050F4:
